@startuml
title 视图 4：DiskOffline 到共享 BG 完成
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor 外部事件 as Outside
participant Router
participant EventService as Event
participant RebuildService as Rebuild
participant "Rebuild TaskSet" as RT
participant BgService as Bg
participant "Bg TaskSet" as BT
database MDC

Outside -> Router : DiskOffline(disk-1, ticket-1)
Router -> Event
Event -> RT : run(dispatch_start)
RT -> Router : StartRebuild(disk-1, ticket-1)
Router -> Rebuild
Rebuild -> RT : run(resolve disk-1)
RT -> MDC : query Disk -> BG
MDC --> RT : {bg-a, bg-shared}
RT --> Rebuild : DiskResolved（同一注册表）

Outside -> Router : DiskOffline(disk-2, ticket-2)
Router -> Event
Event -> RT : dispatch -> StartRebuild
RT --> Rebuild : DiskResolved {bg-shared, bg-b}
note over Rebuild
bg-shared 已存在：只添加 owner=disk-2
不会再产生第二个 BG workflow
end note

loop 并发窗口内持续补位
  Rebuild -> RT : run(delegate bg)
  RT -> Router : DoBgRebuild(bg, oneshot)
  Router -> Bg
  Bg -> BT : run(bg_workflow)
  BT -> MDC : 1. remap
  BT -> MDC : 2. 等待节点重建
  BT -> MDC : 3. 提交 BG 元数据
  BT --> Bg : BgWorkflowFinished
  Bg --> RT : oneshot result
  RT --> Rebuild : BgFinished
end

Rebuild --> Outside : ticket-1 完成（其 BG 均完成）
Rebuild --> Outside : ticket-2 完成（其 BG 均完成）
@enduml

